Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Qué 라이크 슬라이크 슬라이크
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.91,0:00:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,슬라이크 슬라이크 슬라이크 슬라이크
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,슬라onic � comprehension
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.69,0:00:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,consumingyugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Himи protectors, 기 his\NikisubeeYous기 asami KishimiYours했기
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.11,0:00:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,y 'reeu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.53,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and discreetly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.35,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you warned us that thieves\Nhave been after your rare artifacts,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.93,0:01:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,we've taken extra precautions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.49,0:01:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I devised an ingenious plan to transport\Nthe items without a hint of detection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.13,0:01:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,For security reasons,\NI can't tell you how.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.59,0:01:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're loading them in six
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.51,0:01:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,armored vehicles disguised\Nas ordinary garbage trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.27,0:01:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I not correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.09,0:01:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.01,0:01:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your security's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.83,0:01:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say that I have a\Nsixth sense about these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.53,0:01:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll please excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.29,0:01:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I really must get over to the\Nmuseum to set up the exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.71,0:02:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.27,0:02:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost lost the spirit\Nof the puzzle in that fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.35,0:02:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've got a feeling\Nthe worst is yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.35,0:02:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's me, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.59,0:02:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.65,0:02:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.39,0:02:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,In today's news, at Domino Museum,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu Ishtar of the Egyptian\NHistorical Society announced
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.87,0:02:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the opening of her highly\Nanticipated Egyptian exhibit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.09,0:02:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Game fans are especially invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.47,0:02:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This world premiere showcases\Nnewly discovered and never
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.83,0:02:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-before-seen artifacts chronicling\Nthe history of Egyptian games.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.69,0:02:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,In ancient times, games were not\Nplayed just for fun as they are today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.49,0:02:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone from princes to\Npeasants waged dueling
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.89,0:02:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,games against each other\Nfor land and wealth,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.21,0:02:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But especially for power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,These games were epic battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:03:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've unearthed relics that suggest\Nthe great pharaoh himself may have
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.33,0:03:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,competed in a game against a force that\Nthreatened to destroy the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.67,0:03:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, this is still speculation,\Nand further studying needs to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.13,0:03:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to check out the exhibit, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.69,0:03:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.83,0:03:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running a company, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.53,0:03:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for\Nmummies and pharaohs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I thought you'd be into\Nthis kind of thing. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.17,0:03:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Ishizu Ishtar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You should really pay closer\Nattention to my press conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.71,0:03:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you know I was watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.01,0:03:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm personally inviting Seto Kaiba\Nto this evening's private exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.45,0:03:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise what he will witness\Nwill change his life forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.29,0:03:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the engine running.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.63,0:03:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be long. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.53,0:04:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming, Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.77,0:04:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the other guests?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I said this was a private exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.67,0:04:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the only one invited because it\Nmakes conducting business so much easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.55,0:04:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We've locked all the entrances.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's allowed in or out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.81,0:04:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only been a minute,\Nbut I'm already bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.13,0:04:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't tell me what this\Nis all about, I'm leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.67,0:04:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We've faced a string of thefts\Nand we have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.83,0:04:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You may leave any time\Nyou wish, Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.73,0:04:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I believe it's in your best\Ninterest to see all that we have to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Really now? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.65,0:04:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And how do you know what's best for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.39,0:04:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.67,0:04:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, do you believe in destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.71,0:04:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.99,0:04:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ancient Egyptians thought that the true\Npath of one's life was predetermined
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.91,0:05:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,because history repeats itself throughout\Nthe ages in a never-ending circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.27,0:05:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They would say it was not\Nyour choice to come here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.59,0:05:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,for it was destined that\Nthe two of us would meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.81,0:05:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, all that nonsense may interest you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.15,0:05:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't come here\Nfor Egyptian History 101.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.43,0:05:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here because you said\Nit would be worth my while,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but it looks like you've wasted my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.11,0:05:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's a point to all\Nthis, let's get to it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a company to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.33,0:05:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you had an\Nexclusive offer for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I know of your passion for Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.79,0:05:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you interested in owning\Na card stronger than Exodia?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.23,0:05:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know everything about Duel\NMonsters and nothing can stop Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.49,0:05:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So quit the charade and\Ntell me what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All in good time, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.21,0:05:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel Monsters is based\Nupon a 5,000-year-old game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.51,0:05:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It was played by ancient Egyptians\Nfor power and was extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.37,0:05:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.59,0:05:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Maximilian Pegasus did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.73,0:05:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell in love with the game and\Ndecided to reinvent it for modern time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.03,0:05:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.59,0:05:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:06:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbeknownst to most duelists,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.01,0:06:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus created a series of all-powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,cards that were never\Nreleased to the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.85,0:06:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no surprise that he kept the\Nstrongest monsters for himself. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.51,0:06:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me, Kaiba, and I'll reveal\Nthe reason I called you here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.95,0:06:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like whoever's after the\Npuzzle will do anything to get it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,or to make sure that no one else does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.31,0:06:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,When he smashed it to pieces,\Nhe almost destroyed it for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.07,0:06:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We barely made it out of that mess alive,\Nand I know this is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.17,0:06:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in more danger now\Nthan ever. Yes, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.51,0:06:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that you reassembled\Nthe puzzle and our bond is back,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.69,0:06:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,we can face him together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But we have no idea who this guy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.95,0:06:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't even know what he looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But haven't we been in some\Ntough spots before? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.35,0:06:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we'll get through this one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.13,0:07:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.05,0:07:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.25,0:07:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.55,0:07:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.47,0:07:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.21,0:07:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.59,0:07:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.39,0:07:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,To face my destiny. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.21,0:07:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.61,0:07:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've secured the most\Nprecious artifacts here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.83,0:07:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We've recovered stone carvings that depict\Nthe earliest known game played in Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.01,0:07:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you will find it most familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.81,0:07:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, behold the origin of dual monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.69,0:08:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.51,0:08:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,These carvings look\Nlike dual monster cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that means your story is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.89,0:08:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you've come to your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.41,0:08:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, there's a theory that in\Nancient times these monsters were real.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.47,0:08:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Egyptian sorcerers summoned monsters\Nto Earth to do their bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.69,0:08:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But they soon realized that the\Nmonsters could not be controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.37,0:08:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They destroyed countless villages and\Nbrought Earth to the brink of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.79,0:08:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The citizens turned to\Nthe Pharaoh for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.15,0:08:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Though he could not permanently\Ndefeat the monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.85,0:08:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,he managed to use his\Nmagic to seal them away
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.59,0:08:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,in stone tablets and\Nbrought peace to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,However, over time,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.99,0:08:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,evil sorcerers learned how to control the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters and release\Nthem from the tablets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,With their army of powerful monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.85,0:08:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,the sorcerers were confident that\Nno one could stand in their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.05,0:08:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They betrayed the pharaoh and\Nwaged an all-out war against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:09:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the one you must look at.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.43,0:09:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This carving is the reason\NI've called you here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.05,0:09:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It depicts one of the\Nmain conflicts in the war
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.75,0:09:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,between the pharaoh and\Nhis greatest opponent
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.55,0:09:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Closely examine this artifact after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,moment kaiba your life\Nwill never be the same
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,that's the pharaoh
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.81,0:09:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's yugi and the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.13,0:09:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,monster carved above him\Nis the dark magician on
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.77,0:09:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,the left is the sorcerer\Nfighting against him
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.39,0:09:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,that's you kaiba If you\Nstill have any doubt,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.77,0:09:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,look at his monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.31,0:09:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the blue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.11,0:09:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The hieroglyphics read\Nthat the mighty sorcerer
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.89,0:09:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,marched into the pharaoh's\Nchamber and challenged
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.51,0:09:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,him and his legion of noble magicians to a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.79,0:09:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,legendary duel with the\Nfate of the world at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:10:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh accepted the sorcerer's\Nchallenge, and their epic battle began.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.13,0:10:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Both opponents unleashed their most\Npowerful monsters against each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sorcerer fighting\Nto control the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.07,0:10:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Pharaoh and his loyal\Nfollowers fighting to save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.19,0:10:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, 5,000 years later, this ancient\Nbattle is being played out once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.13,0:10:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do you believe in destiny, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.73,0:10:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.41,0:10:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.83,0:10:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This piece of rock has got to be a fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't trust my words,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.39,0:10:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,then you must look back in time and\Nexperience a part of the battle firsthand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.97,0:10:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Which I can help you do\Nwith my Millennium necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.41,0:10:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, open your mind and see into the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.21,0:10:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.09,0:11:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I hereby declare a\Nchallenge to the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.07,0:11:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,By the rites of tradition, duel\Nme if you are not a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.63,0:11:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic powers, heed my cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.63,0:11:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Release the monster trapped inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic powers, heed my cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Release the monster trapped inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,As the Pharaoh's loyal servant, I\Nwill stand against you, traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.05,0:11:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I banish you all to the Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.89,0:11:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.69,0:11:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.01,0:11:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like a total loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.07,0:11:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost lost you and the\Npuzzle forever in that fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.79,0:11:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can face this enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:11:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I mess up again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.55,0:11:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.49,0:12:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Only because my friends came and saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.01,0:12:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I'd never have escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.27,0:12:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to believe in\Nyourself like I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.69,0:12:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In all my years, I have never encountered\Na soul as brave as yours, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a reason why fate handed you the\NMillennium Puzzle and brought us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.11,0:12:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the heart of a true champion\Nand a soul that is courageous and true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,In another time, you\Ncould have been Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.65,0:12:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel raged on with neither\Nside showing any mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.47,0:12:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They summoned monsters that were\Nincreasingly more powerful and vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.45,0:12:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of the duel was written here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.55,0:12:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but as you can see, the\Nhieroglyphics have been worn away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.69,0:12:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but though we don't know the outcome,\Nthere's still much that we can learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.03,0:12:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us take a glance into the past again\Nusing the powers of my Millennium Necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.41,0:13:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your legend may be strong, but did\Nyou think I would not come prepared?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.27,0:13:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It is no match for the\Ncombined fury of my dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.49,0:13:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Unite, my dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.87,0:13:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.91,0:13:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.82,0:13:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Bombard the traitor with\Nyour blazing Inferno!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.93,0:13:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You have not won yet, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.27,0:13:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It is far from over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.69,0:13:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think one of your pathetic\Nminions have the magic to defeat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I will shatter them from existence\Nright before your very eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That sorcerer's a big mouth\Nlosing chump. You can't compare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,him to me well then maybe the\Nfinal vision will convince you no
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.07,0:14:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,you should have finished\Nme off when you had
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.29,0:14:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the chance for i will now\Ncall forth the ultimate
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.21,0:14:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,beast of destruction now\Npharaoh this is the end
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.93,0:14:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My faithful monsters, you\Nhave all served me well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,wake from your eternal slumber\Nand obey me one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, I will offer them, infuse their\Nlife forces into the legendary dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the Blue-Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes White Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.73,0:14:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon, destroy them all\Nwith your white lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.19,0:15:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now are you convinced, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said before, history is\Ndestined to repeat itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.55,0:15:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just coincidence that\NYugi is your greatest opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.85,0:15:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You two have battled in the ancient past.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.77,0:15:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It was destiny that you and Yugi dueled,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.43,0:15:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's destined that\Nyou two will battle again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.93,0:15:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.39,0:15:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But I make my own destiny,\Nand I do what I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.61,0:15:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, what I thought you\Nwanted were powerful monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.49,0:15:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The Duel Monsters cards that\Nsurpassed the power of Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.73,0:15:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I told you they were in front\Nof your eyes the whole time? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.55,0:16:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.57,0:16:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They were the strongest and most\Nfeared creatures of Annihilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.93,0:16:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.99,0:16:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer the Sky Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The Winged Dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.37,0:16:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, control one, and you can destroy\Na million armies, wield all three,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.49,0:16:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and the planet itself will quake in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.01,0:16:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And Pegasus turned them into cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.81,0:16:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. You lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.93,0:16:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If he had them, why didn't he use\Nthem against me at Duelist Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.31,0:16:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Pegasus feared the power\Nof these Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot fathom the magical\Nenergy contained within.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.13,0:16:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus could not control the\Npower of the cards he created.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They threatened to\Noverwhelm and destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.25,0:16:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Cards that even make\NPegasus quake in his boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.09,0:16:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can obtain the three legendary\Nmonsters, I'll be unstoppable in any duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.55,0:16:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi won't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.21,0:16:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do I get them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't ask Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.93,0:16:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dropped off the face of the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.59,0:16:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They have to exist somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.51,0:16:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mishizu, what did Pegasus\Ndo with the cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.39,0:17:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He gave them to me for safekeeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.53,0:17:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus realized that if these\Ncards fell into the wrong hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.87,0:17:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,they could bring about\Nthe end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.07,0:17:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He had me bury them in secret locations,\Nbut the cards were discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.09,0:17:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I must find them and hide them once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.25,0:17:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean someone already\Nfound the cards? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.17,0:17:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me who.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.43,0:17:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The Rare Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Rare Hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.57,0:17:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a ruthless underground\Nsect of elite duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.63,0:17:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They rob and steal rare cards worldwide to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.05,0:17:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,sell on the black market for\Nenormous profits. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.61,0:17:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,they keep the strongest\Ncards for themselves to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.05,0:17:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,create powerful decks that\Ndestroy all opposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.75,0:17:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They operate in shadow, so they\Nare nearly impossible to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.45,0:17:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why I need your help\Nto draw them out into the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.85,0:17:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, if you were to start\Na Duel Monsters tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,your reputation would attract the\Ngreatest duelists in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.03,0:17:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This would be the\Ngreatest concentration of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.47,0:18:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,precious cards ever\Nassembled in one location.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.01,0:18:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.01,0:18:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.25,0:18:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The rare hunters won't be able\Nto resist such tempting bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.75,0:18:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll come by the droves,\Nlike vultures to a carcass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.59,0:18:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And they'll bring the Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.99,0:18:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,One last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.63,0:18:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.39,0:18:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.29,0:18:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Obelisk the Tormentor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the cards were stolen!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.45,0:18:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said they were all stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.47,0:18:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I managed to retrieve one in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You may borrow it during the\Ntournament, but I expect it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.59,0:18:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not every day a card\Nthis rare is handed to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.71,0:18:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I chose to keep it forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.21,0:18:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think I can be trusted?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.55,0:18:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I could walk out and\Nyou'd never see it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.89,0:18:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You will return the card to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.01,0:18:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I have foreseen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.31,0:18:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You may not yet believe in destiny,\Nbut before the tournament is done,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.71,0:18:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,you will have to face your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.83,0:19:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I read that\Nonce in a fortune cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.93,0:19:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll organize this\Ntournament. I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.07,0:19:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not going to set\Nit up because of your
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.41,0:19:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,fairy tales and your\Nhocus-pocus mind tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.31,0:19:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to reclaim my title\Nas the number one duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.53,0:19:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish we knew more about our new enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.77,0:19:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he was familiar with\Nthe power of a Millennium Item.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet he has one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.95,0:19:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be how he\Ncontrols people's minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.67,0:19:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It also seems he has knowledge\Nof the ancient customs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Our foe is somehow connected to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.95,0:19:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But who is he? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.23,0:19:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how can we stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.63,0:19:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.69,0:19:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We can defeat this evil together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we stay connected,\Nyou and I can face anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.11,0:19:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but what if I fail again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.73,0:19:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I know that I won't lose you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.89,0:20:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.97,0:20:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,One car down and two more to go
